    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dreamcatcher </strong>is a proof of concept for a hand-drawn 2.5D adventure platformer where you explore a collection of floating islands as Kit, the Dreamcatcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains some basic resource gathering minigames, directional combat, a few NPCs to chat with, and a few things that need to be repaired around the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only takes around 15 minutes to experience everything, and can probably be completed in a few minutes if you know what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was an entirely solo project, and there are not immediate plans to work on a full game as of now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dreamcatcher </strong>is a proof of concept for a hand-drawn 2.5D adventure platformer where you explore a collection of floating islands as Kit, the Dreamcatcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains some basic resource gathering minigames, directional combat, a few NPCs to chat with, and a few things that need to be repaired around the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only takes around 15 minutes to experience everything, and can probably be completed in a few minutes if you know what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was an entirely solo project, and there are not immediate plans to work on a full game as of now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!</p>",
